lass=\"ihb-default\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Prepare email</span></span><span class=\"ihb-hover\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Prepare email</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path></svg></span></button><small>This opens a prepared email in your mail app. Nothing is sent automatically.</small></form><div id=\"contact-success\" hidden=\"\"><p>Your email is ready. Send it to the IcyPluto team from your mail app.</p><a id=\"email-link\" class=\"pill pill--dark interactive-hover-button\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ihb-default\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Open email app</span></span><span class=\"ihb-hover\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Open email app</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path></svg></span></a></div></dialog>\r\n<dialog id=\"resource-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"resource-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\">\u00d7</button><span id=\"resource-label\" class=\"folio\"></span><h2 id=\"resource-title\"></h2><p id=\"resource-description\"></p><div id=\"resource-details\"></div><button id=\"resource-contact\" class=\"pill pill--dark interactive-hover-button\"><span class=\"ihb-default\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Register interest</span></span><span class=\"ihb-hover\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Register interest</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path></svg></span></button><small>Dates and programming will be announced.</small></dialog>\r\n"}